## Notes on Arguments and Attributes

- `install`: What happens when the first install fails: `retries`, `remediate_last_failure`, `strategy`.
- `upgrade`: What happens when an upgrade fails: `retries`, `remediate_last_failure`, `strategy`.
- `parallel`: Staggered rollout settings: `batch_count`, `batch_increment_by`, `delay`, `timeout`, `failure_action`.
- `kubernetes_prune`: Defaults to `.`.

